# 📘 TOEFL Academic Vocabulary - Day23

| Word | Meaning | Example |
|---|---|---|
| evident | 명백한 | It is evident that the climate is changing. |
| crucial | 매우 중요한 | Water is crucial for plant growth. |
| compensate | 보상하다, 상쇄하다 | Trees can compensate for some environmental damage. |

---

## Synonyms

### evident
→ obvious / clear

### crucial
→ essential / vital

### compensate
→ offset / make up for

---

## Useful Collocations

evident difference
→ 명백한 차이

crucial role
→ 중요한 역할

compensate for
→ ~을 보완하다 / 상쇄하다

